# (his script: 255). The harness clock starts at day 8000, 12:00. Available: area 12: 5080: begun. Prog 0, Wait 0:
# Abquhbah 5087 (an Event, once per zone); again: 255; four Gold Pieces: under five: nil; six: 5081: five taken
# (tradeHas confirms only them), Wait today. Wait today: 5088 (an Event). A day on: 5082 ([0] = 0), option 2: Stage 1,
# Wait today; 5088; then the script's turn: 255. A day on: 5082 ([0] = 1), option 1: Prog 1, Stage 0. Prog 1, Wait
# today: 5083 ([0] = 0), option 2: Stage 1; 5083 ([0] = 1), option 1: Prog 2. Prog 2: 5084 ([0] = 0), option 1: Stage 1;
# 5084 ([0] = 1), option 0: Prog 3. Prog 3: 5089 ([0] = 0: Wait is today; importantOnce), finished at about 12:30: not
# 15:00-16:59: nothing; again (Default now; the script's turn): 255. Three hours on (about 15:30): 5089 (Default),
# finished: Prog 4, needToZone. Prog 4 with needToZone: 5089 keeps importantOnce's Default (the lookup's local var by
# csid) and the script has its turn: 255; then 5089 ([0] = 1). Nashmau and back (the local vars cleared): 5085:
# completed (the FL Wildcat Badge, First Lieutenant), the SL badge taken, FIRST_LIEUTENANT (user ruling 2026-11-04,
# kept Lua bugs: the Lua dropped it), AssaultPromotion 0.
